<title>FRANCE: Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments as of January 14 in the July-to-June 1996/97 campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On January 16, the EU additionally granted exports of 343,100 tonnes of soft wheat, 172,500 tonnes of barley, 6,201 tonnes of rye, and 42,000 tonnes of oats though its weekly grain tender system.</p>
<p>Figures ('000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
<p>			 ---------1996/97-------  ------1995/96-----</p>
<p>			     1Jul96 to 14Jan 97     1Jul95 to 14Jan96</p>
<p>			 EXPORTS  PCT(1) IMPORTS  EXPORTS    IMPORTS</p>
<p>  Soft wheat(grain)  6,078     142     720    4,292	1,051</p>
<p>  Flour (2)	    3,826     127	10    3,007	   12</p>
<p>Food aid</p>
<p>    - grain		246	69	 0	358	    0</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	  101	93	 0	109	    0</p>
<p>Donations</p>
<p>    - grain		  0		   -	305	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	    9		   0	 57	    0</p>
<p> TOTAL SOFT WHEAT   10,260     126     730    8,128	1,063</p>
<p>  Durum (grain)	   91		 314	 16	  726</p>
<p>  Semolina (3)	   288     929	 0	 31	    0</p>
<p>  Food aid		   1		   0	 53	    0</p>
<p> TOTAL DURUM WHEAT     380     380     314	100	  726</p>
<p> ALL WHEAT	    10,640     129   1,044    8,228	1,789</p>
<p>  Barley (grain)     3,551     290	30    1,223	  119</p>
<p>  Malt (4)	     2,452     112	 0    2,187	    0</p>
<p>  Donations		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL BARLEY	  6,003     176	30    3,410	  119</p>
<p>  Maize (grain)	   39     975     275	  4	1,879</p>
<p>  Food aid		  11		   -	 11	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL MAIZE		50     122     275	 41	1,879</p>
<p>  Rye (grain)	    672	57	 3    1,170	   33</p>
<p>  Rye flour (5)	    0		   0	  0	    0</p>
<p>Donations</p>
<p>    - grain		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (5)	    0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL RYE		 672	57	 3     1,170	  33</p>
<p> OATS			246     600	 1	 41	    1</p>
<p>  Sorghum (grain)	  0		   4	  0	  749</p>
<p>  Food aid		   0		   -	  0	    -</p>
