<p>Buckwheat, Millet,</p>
<p>   Triticale		 1		 136	  1	   73</p>
<p> TOTAL GRAIN	  17,612     137   1,493   12,891	4,643</p>
<p>Note -- (1) column shows this year's exports expressed as a percentage of last year's exports, not as a percentage change (2) wheat equivalent (3) durum equivalent (4) barley equivalent (5) rye equivalent. -- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
